WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.460
Federal work is won long before the first drawing.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.360
Rhodo watches SAM.gov for the opportunities

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.860
that fit your firm.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.620
It reads every solicitation,

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.960
and shows you where you stand, and why.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.980
It matches your past projects with the people who delivered

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.520
them, builds your experience matrix,

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.320
and brings your SF330 together, ready for review.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.300
AI does the groundwork.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.780
Your team makes the calls.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.440
Rhodo.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.920
From SAM.gov to a winning proposal.
